Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是職業球探吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.10,0:02:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和之前來這裏的人不同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.90,0:02:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是被全球壇所注目的高中生黃金右碗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.40,0:02:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.50,0:02:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是羨慕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.00,0:02:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}被玷污的投手丘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室…室井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒…沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們倆是一箇中學的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.50,0:03:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道室井家的對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幫我送他回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但…但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你們應該知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你們兩個鬧着玩從堤壩上摔下來的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這算什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.60,0:03:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.90,0:03:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 巖下 我求你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 他就拜託你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.60,0:03:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是沒什麼事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.90,0:03:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是跟老師反映一下事實真相吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.10,0:03:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說了又能怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.40,0:03:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種事情宣揚出去一下子就會被禁賽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家應該和我一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.50,0:03:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都很想參加大賽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.60,0:04:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能出線之後就是全國大賽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.40,0:04:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然不甘心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但爲了這個沒有那個小子不行嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.70,0:04:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我一個人忍忍就沒事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 爲什麼會被打啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.70,0:04:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是因爲越受注目也就有越多的壓力吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.80,0:04:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 失望啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.20,0:04:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼倍受職業球壇矚目的高中生黃金右腕嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(656,469)}好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.20,0:04:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(380,469)}哎呀哎呀 到底發生了什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.30,0:04:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然把他從堤壩上推下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬧着玩時 一不小心就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.10,0:04:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬧過頭了吧 真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次當心點 知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是見到室井的最後一面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.30,0:04:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井在第二天和第三天都沒有來學校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後在之後的那天早晨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有個令大家悲痛的消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.70,0:05:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1年C班的室井伸一不幸去世
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說似乎是內臟破裂啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.90,0:05:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做了什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是被誰打了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.90,0:05:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲室井君的去世默哀一分鐘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼有什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.50,0:05:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了啊 室井他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎是這樣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是前輩你的錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的錯嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼證據
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.90,0:05:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,證…證據 這種東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼可能有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.90,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起這個 你倒應該擔心一下自己吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真的假的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.80,0:06:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.50,0:06:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說午夜零點登錄的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.70,0:06:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女就會幫你消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕 不要再說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.60,0:06:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教導主任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是刑警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.20,0:06:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關於室井的死有些事想要問你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 我嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說你將他從堤壩上推了下去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.50,0:06:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.70,0:06:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過呢 從驗屍結果看如果不用棒裝物體毆打的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該不會造成這樣的傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.10,0:06:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.00,0:06:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼一回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是那樣的話 大賽就完了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.70,0:06:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺人犯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.00,0:07:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的錯 都是因爲你伸一才
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸一有多痛苦你知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在臨死的時候還在喊疼啊 疼啊的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.70,0:07:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在牀上翻滾着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.40,0:07:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便如此那個孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.80,0:07:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還在說不是你的錯 不是你的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:26.80,0:07:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.00,0:07:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把伸一還給我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 冷靜點啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.70,0:07:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.30,0:07:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井 我和你約定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果成了職業選手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會連你那份一起努力的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是花笠啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是了不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.90,0:08:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.80,0:08:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這混帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸 聽我說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都誤會我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真不知道說什麼好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.00,0:08:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想您都無法原諒他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.90,0:08:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是請您 請您
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去 滾回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們回去 今天我們會回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.70,0:08:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我們改日再登門道歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要道歉可不便宜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.80,0:08:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幾千萬 不 還是幾億
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.30,0:08:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我該怎麼做好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.50,0:08:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 求你們了 請相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎樣請你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先跟我們走一趟再說吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(400,0)}君之怨恨    願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個傳言 是真的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想去嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.70,0:10:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係的 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.60,0:10:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無可奈何啊 不幹不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無可奈何啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次之後就連不上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼時候在那裏的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.80,0:11:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.50,0:11:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.80,0:12:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過是死之後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 哪裏去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.90,0:12:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大賽都無法參加了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.30,0:12:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛還要練習啊 棒球部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.70,0:12:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正式指示還沒下來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可真是災難啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.70,0:13:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我經常都在想 不覺得連帶責任不妥嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠同學 真可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠同學在大賽上的活躍表現
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直很期待的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.50,0:13:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同學 不用離這那遠 過來這邊吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 沒事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.90,0:13:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我來了 快出來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.40,0:13:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠 前輩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.50,0:13:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.70,0:13:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己做的事 請自己承擔起責任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.90,0:13:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對於我來說 這過於沉重了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以爲我會說“是 我會的”嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.30,0:14:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不答應的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.00,0:14:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣的話我也有的辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.00,0:14:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將真相申訴出來嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.30,0:14:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是這個你昨晚也試過了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.70,0:14:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過好像沒有人相信你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.10,0:14:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠前輩對於室井的死一點想法都沒有的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.60,0:14:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不過覺得他很倒黴哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 沒想到他會死掉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太弱了 從一開始他就不適合打棒球呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.80,0:14:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 你要打我也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是等於你自己認罪了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.00,0:14:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有 把我打傷了可不會簡單了事哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.80,0:14:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果把我投球的手弄傷可是很嚴重的事情哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.50,0:14:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上室井的賠償費 你們家就要破產了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.50,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎麼辦啊 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.20,0:14:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼樣關我屁事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要露出這種表情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我還要感謝你和室井呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.50,0:15:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多虧你們 可以不用參加大賽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部員們可能想要留些青春的回憶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過爲了這個就要耗損我的肩膀就有點…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.90,0:15:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,球探們似乎也建議我不要參賽呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帳 難道說是故意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.90,0:15:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意的話 你又想怎樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.40,0:15:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經夠了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.70,0:15:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井他 室井他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦地 痛苦地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.90,0:15:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.50,0:15:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我又沒有看見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.20,0:15:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經夠了 沒事了吧 再見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.40,0:15:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是勸你早點去警察那自首比較好哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.50,0:15:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然審訊時會給法官留下種種不好的印象的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.40,0:16:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.80,0:16:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 長衫放好了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.80,0:16:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.30,0:16:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們想把你作爲今年選秀的第一指名
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也願意出大量契約的金
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多多關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.20,0:17:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.00,0:17:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.80,0:17:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠 花笠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.00,0:17:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺人兇手 殺人兇手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎 怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暫停
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有最後一個人出局就是完封了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 這是什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用在意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.60,0:18:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道這是人的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.70,0:18:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 還有一個出局
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 不知道出局的意思嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.20,0:18:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告訴你吧 就是殺了的意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.70,0:18:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井出局 巖下出局
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.20,0:18:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,室井出局 巖下出局
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.90,0:18:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花笠出局
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開什麼玩笑啊 你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.50,0:18:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打者 巖下君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.80,0:18:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巖下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.20,0:18:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你乾的好事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.70,0:18:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,適可而止吧 真是煩人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧吧 這樣就到賽點了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.80,0:19:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們可不想聽什麼藉口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是爲你準備的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.50,0:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惡作劇也要適可而止啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是惡作劇啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒球就是事關生死的嚴肅比賽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.90,0:19:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 繼續比賽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會讓你得逞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我去死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.40,0:19:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全上壘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的手…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.70,0:19:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不承認自己的罪嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.00,0:19:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺了一個人 還讓另一個人承擔罪責不是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.50,0:20:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不覺得那兩個人可憐嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們會怎麼樣關我什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.00,0:20:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以爲自己會打點棒球就跟一般人不同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什麼事情都會被原諒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.50,0:20:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自以爲是也要有個限度啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.90,0:20:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們都不看報紙的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是稍微會打點的程度而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.10,0:20:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是被稱爲十年難得一見的奇才啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:23.80,0:20:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不能打棒球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日本 不 對世界職業棒球來說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.30,0:20:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會給帶來多大的影響你不知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們應該知道吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巖下也好 室井也好都一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了我而死應該可以瞑目了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.50,0:20:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他這麼說呢 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.50,0:20:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.30,0:20:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.90,0:20:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是在哪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.10,0:21:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.30,0:21:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是因爲想打棒球而進入棒球部的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.50,0:21:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是和花笠同學不同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我或許不能成爲職業選手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.50,0:21:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是就算玩玩業餘棒球也好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.50,0:21:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以一直想繼續打棒球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:32.60,0:21:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過已經再也不能打棒球了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這麼想打 隨你怎麼去打不就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.60,0:21:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 那麼我們一起打好了 花笠同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.00,0:21:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一個人去打 我纔不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 花笠同學你不知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.40,0:21:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒球一個人是沒辦法打的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.70,0:22:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.20,0:22:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然說是少年A
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實很明顯的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.60,0:22:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還說是職業界非常矚目的棒球王牌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是 在報紙和電視上也常露臉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.40,0:22:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目擊者也說他用棒球棍毆打後輩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就知道那個人是花笠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:27.70,0:22:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他到底消失到哪裏去了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拜託過你伯母了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.40,0:22:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什麼困難就馬上打電話給我們好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.20,0:22:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:42.00,0:22:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶爾的話 你是不是也能回一次家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.60,0:22:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等事情平靜下來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:49.00,0:22:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我想這需要花費一點時間吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.00,0:23:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.20,0:23:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.70,0:23:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
