Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.12,0:24:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.60,0:24:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菅野純子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.10,0:24:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被騙了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本來還相信醫生的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.30,0:24:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,動物無法說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.60,0:24:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道這點而做出那種行爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.30,0:24:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.20,0:24:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:50.90,0:24:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將他流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.70,0:24:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.60,0:25:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.60,0:25:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}聽不到的叫聲
